hood of adhesions causing a mechanical obstruction."}, "action_intents": [{"t": 3, "intent": "broaden"}, {"t": 3, "intent": "refute"}, {"t": 3, "intent": "broaden"}, {"t": 3, "intent": "broaden"}, {"t": 3, "intent": "broaden"}, {"t": 3, "intent": "broaden"}], "considered_alternatives": ["B3", "B6", "B4"]}, "discriminator_hints": "[Knowledge Layer: coverage=38%, source=both]\n\nInfectious Gastroenteritis vs Chronic Constipation with Impaction:\n  Favours first:  abnormality of the gastrointestinal tract, ascites, atopic dermatitis, bloody diarrhea, body aches\n  Favours second: bloating, feeling of incomplete evacuation, hard stools, headache, infrequent bowel movements\n\nInfectious Gastroenteritis vs Strangulated Hernia:\n  Favours first:  abdominal pain, abnormality of the gastrointestinal tract, ascites, atopic dermatitis, bloody diarrhea\n  Favours second: blood in stools, constipation, inability to pass gas or have a bowel movement, nausea and vomiting, severe abdominal or groin pain\n\nChronic Constipation with Impaction vs Strangulated Hernia:\n  Favours first:  abdominal pain, bloating, feeling of incomplete evacuation, hard stools, headache\n  Favours second: blood in stools, constipation, fever, inability to pass gas or have a bowel movement, nausea and vomiting\n\nRelated to Infectious Gastroenteritis: campylobacteriosis, colitis (disease), enteritis\n\n[Indirect reasoning chains (PrimeKG 2-hop):]\n  A 55-year-old man presents to the emergency department with nausea and vomiting for the past week → abdominal pain → Infectious Gastroenteritis\n  A 55-year-old man presents to the emergency department with nausea and vomiting for the past week → vomiting → Infectious Gastroenteritis\n  A 55-year-old man presents to the emergency department with nausea and vomiting for the past week → vomiting → Infectious Gastroenteritis"}
